{"id":"00239","root":"uni00239_1","name":{"ja":"神村　舞華","en":"Kamimura Maika"},"title":{"ja":"【爆炎のギャル】","en":"【Exploding Gal】"},"displayName":{"ja":"【爆炎のギャル】 神村　舞華","en":"【Exploding Gal】 Kamimura Maika"},"element":"Natural","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","roles":[],"traits":["Taimanin"],"release":"2019-09-12","limited":false,"characterId":59,"profile":{"ja":"火遁の術を操る対魔忍。火遁使いの中でも最高クラスの火力を誇るが、強力過ぎて制御が難しく、パワー制御のために特別に製作された携帯式火砲を使用している。彼女が“冥途バズーカ”と名付けたその火砲の中に火球弾を発生させて発射、着弾すると、超高熱の爆炎が噴き上げ一瞬で魔を滅殺する。言葉使いは荒々しいヤンキー娘だが、弱きを助け強きを挫く昔ながらの番長のような性格。硬派を気取りつつも本当はギャルに憧れていて、時おりギャルのファッションに身を包んで知り合いのいない街を闊歩する事も。自宅の秘密の宝箱の中は可愛いもので溢れている。","en":"Kamimura Maika is a Taimanin who manipulates fire-style techniques. Among fire-style users she boasts top-tier firepower, but her flames are so intense that they're hard to control, so she wields a specially crafted portable fire cannon for power regulation. She named the cannon \"Nether-Realm Bazooka\"; it generates fireball projectiles that, upon impact, unleash scorching explosions that instantly annihilate demons. Her speech is rough, like a delinquent girl, and she has the classic boss-type personality of helping the weak and crushing the strong. Though she tries to act tough, she secretly admires gal culture and sometimes roams unfamiliar towns dressed in gal fashion. Her secret treasure chest at home overflows with cute items."},"illustrator":"Sian","voiceActor":"佐倉もも花","forms":[{"id":"uni00239_1","rarity":3,"rarityLabel":"HR","levelMax":60,"stats":{"hp":[1012,2024],"sp":[160,160],"atk":[146,292],"def":[110,220],"spd":[57,57],"luck":[1,90]},"spCharge":38,"skills":["4","310007"]},{"id":"uni00239_2","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1524,3048],"sp":[250,250],"atk":[227,454],"def":[155,310],"spd":[57,57],"luck":[1,90]},"spCharge":38,"skills":["4","310007","310008"]},{"id":"uni00239_3","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","levelMax":90,"stats":{"hp":[2036,4084],"sp":[320,320],"atk":[313,623],"def":[205,411],"spd":[57,57],"luck":[1,9